# SecretSweep ignore file
# Copy this to .secretsweepignore in the root of whatever you're scanning.
#
# Two kinds of lines are supported:
#
# 1) Path globs — skip scanning these paths entirely (e.g. test fixtures
#    that intentionally contain fake secrets for testing this very tool):
test/fixtures/**
spec/fixtures/**

# 2) Fingerprints — allowlist ONE specific confirmed false positive by its
#    12-character fingerprint, as printed in a scan report. This does NOT
#    silence the whole rule, only that exact (file + type + snippet):
# a1b2c3d4e5f6
